["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.292｜施展×刘擎：从阴山互市到上海口岸，碰撞中的秩序生成 impersonal plus game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-cn27f438-明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市-战争立刻消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">35:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市，战争立刻消失了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉靖朝南倭北虏打得筋疲力尽，换了皇帝开放互市和海禁，战争就没了——贸易不是零和博弈，规则常常是在冲突耗尽双方之后、在交往界面上长出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度史</span><span class=\"tag\">上海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Indigenous Entomology (BUGS &amp; TRADITIONAL ECOLOGICAL KNOWLEDGE) with Cheyenne Reuben-Thomas cultural fire Three Sisters traditional ecological knowledge (TEK)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-ologies-入侵物种也在-干自己的活-原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>入侵物种也在&quot;干自己的活&quot;:原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲蜜蜂、亚洲瓢虫这类常被叫作「入侵种」的生物，在原住民生态知识里被看作在履行各自的生态职责，而不是非黑即白的敌人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">昆虫学</span><span class=\"tag\">原住民知识</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"BI 250 Nima Dehghani: How Brains Compute computational closure functor divisive normalization winner-take-all wave walker / pilot wave\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-braininspired-ai-的-智能体-说法是误称-自主性要靠计算闭合-不是算力堆出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9d77f3058f9aa91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brain Inspired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的「智能体」说法是误称：自主性要靠计算闭合，不是算力堆出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判断一个系统有没有自主性，不是看它能不能做图灵完备的运算，而是看它的内部回路能不能自己闭合——这正是现在所谓AI agent名不副实的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">计算理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"157. 复盘Personal Agent集体诞生背后：和蔡伟聊AI产品史、需求真伪、入口与未来想象 harness MCP A2A\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-zhangxiaojun-个人助理的竞争短期看模型-中长期拼的是供给和安全信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c56751483666a88-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>个人助理的竞争短期看模型，中长期拼的是供给和安全信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蔡伟判断模型能力早晚会进入稳态、各家大差不差，届时真正拉开差距的是谁手握更多线下供给、谁的安全合规做得足够深。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI产品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"对话 Google Cloud FDE 负责人王书元：FDE落到企业上，第一步是造“样板间” FDE brain in a vat FDE BP nano banana self-distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-guijilichang-别急着买工具-企业ai落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立场</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>别急着买工具，企业AI落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王书元说，AI不像数据库这类旧技术升级——每个人对AI都有自己的理解，靠集思广益很难推进，企业应该先在一个部门做出能闭环的样板，再靠示范效应说服全公司跟进。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Are We Addicted to Control? with Dr Anna Lembke infinite flexibility mental map / mental model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-iq2-你的焦虑不是缺乏控制-而是控制过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e254f7f220660b07-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">40:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>你的焦虑不是缺乏控制，而是控制过了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lembke 认为现代人的恐惧、孤独和羞耻感根源于「无限可塑性」的幻觉——以为自己能掌控一切，结果一旦失控就只剩自责，而真正的解药是向自己之外的更高力量交出意志。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">自恋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"414. Lawrence of Arabia: Palestine, Iraq, &amp; The Motorcycle Crash (Part 4)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-empirehist-劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会-犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">57:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会，犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1919年巴黎和会上，阿拉伯代表团迟到、无文件、无策略，而犹太复国主义代表团已游说六周并备好详细的水权与移民方案，这场较量从一开始就不对等。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴以冲突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Databricks CEO: AGI Is Already Here, Why Companies Are Behind, and the Superintelligence Debate ontology RSI (recursive self-improvement) paperclip maximizer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-allin-他说agi去年就实现了-企业落后是因为连会都不敢录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74597b3fa701beb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>他说AGI去年就实现了，企业落后是因为连会都不敢录</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ali Ghodsi认为用他们当年AMP实验室的定义，AGI去年就已达成，但企业卡在第一步——银行CEO直接拒绝让AI记录会议，没有上下文，再强的模型也帮不上忙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Water in the Mantle with Rita Parai mantle plume primordial isotope radiogenic isotope late veneer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-geologybites-地幔柱的源头一开始是干的-水是后来被俯冲带进去的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9574accafd612c22-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">29:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>地幔柱的源头一开始是干的，水是后来被俯冲带进去的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">惰性气体同位素模型显示，地幔柱源头在地球吸积末期的水分比上地幔少4到250倍，但如今却靠俯冲带水反超上地幔达20倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地幔</span><span class=\"tag\">地幔柱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Learn to Improve Itself? | Recursive Self-Improvement RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) perplexity chain of thought monitorability confessions research\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-a16z-ai研究员已经存在-但还没学会-品味/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>AI研究员已经存在，但还没学会「品味」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI和Thinking Machines的两位核心研究者认为，AI已能自主跑实验、加速研究，但判断哪个想法值得追的「品味」，仍然主要来自人类研究者的经验而非模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to compress text to 1 bit per character | Compression is Intelligence Part 3 arithmetic coding Hutter Prize cross-entropy asymmetric numeral system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-karpathy-把文本压到每字符不到1比特-算术编码揭示压缩即预测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574b8c7bf81d687f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>把文本压到每字符不到1比特：算术编码揭示压缩即预测</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">任何文本预测器都能通过算术编码几乎无损地变成压缩器，反过来压缩器也能还原出预测分布——压缩率本质上取决于语言模型预测的好坏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">语言模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"我给机械臂装了个本地大模型：几行代码就能干的活，为什么要用AI？ NPU XDNA2 BFP16/BlockFP16 prefill/decode full fusion Quark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-laoshi-给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准-是为听懂模糊指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b649dce3e37e38-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">15:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准，是为听懂模糊指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统程序几行代码就能让机械臂转20度，但做不到理解「跟大家打个招呼」这种模糊意图——这才是用AI的真正理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">端侧推理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Gerstner &amp; Geoffrey Canada - Raising the Floor for Every American Child - [Invest Like the Best, EP.501] 530A account / Trump account cold start problem CalKids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-ilt-美国已为7000万儿童自动开户-账户永久不可被国会撤销/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb9087b8e12d941-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美国已为7000万儿童自动开户，账户永久不可被国会撤销</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">账户创建条款写进法律永久生效，像社保一样不会因换届被废除；真正每届国会要重新拨款的只是出生时那1000美元的联邦种子资金，到2029年前已有资金保障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The secret to raising independent kids: Why connection matters more than you think with Dr. David Willis early relational health rupture and repair reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-secureattach-独立不是教出来的-是安全连接的副产品-搞反顺序孩子反而更不安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>独立不是教出来的，是安全连接的副产品，搞反顺序孩子反而更不安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家长普遍相信先教独立再谈连接，但 Dr. Willis 认为自主、自信其实是强连接的副产品——过早逼孩子独立，得到的是不安全感而不是独立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Know the Score credit freeze hard inquiry FICO score\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-ninepi-信用分数本想消除偏见-却把历史不平等原样算进了分数里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>信用分数本想消除偏见，却把历史不平等原样算进了分数里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FICO算法确实让贷款人不能再因为性别种族当面拒绝你，但它照单全收了几百年种族歧视造成的财富差距，再把这个差距冻结成一个三位数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用评分</span><span class=\"tag\">金融史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Colin Elliott &amp; Pox Romana Pax Romana Antonine Plague orthopoxvirus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-tpwky-罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手-道路-军队-贸易网全在帮倒忙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手：道路、军队、贸易网全在帮倒忙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史学家Colin Elliott认为，这场瘟疫致死率可能只有1%-2%，但罗马帝国本就结构脆弱，疫情只是加速了它本来就要发生的崩溃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">瘟疫史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"298. Your Angry Son’s Outbursts: Set Limits Without Power Struggles | Dr. Tori Cordiano identified patient emotion regulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-asklisa-惩罚越升级-愤怒少年越自毁-他宁可失去一切也不服从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eed6f40091580f12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>惩罚越升级，愤怒少年越自毁：他宁可失去一切也不服从</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14岁男孩情绪失控时，没收游戏、加重惩罚只会触发他为了拒绝被控制而自我毁灭一切；真正管用的是先守住安全和尊重两条底线，再靠关系里攒下的好感维系约束力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Kindergarten Growing Pains: Should We Worry?\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-unruffled-幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败-反而是信任的证明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">33:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败，反而是信任的证明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个孩子被老师评为「领袖」却天天哭着上学，另一个孩子因为太会「扮演乖孩子」而在家崩溃——两种表现背后其实是同一件事：孩子在学校扛了很多，回家才敢卸下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童教育</span><span class=\"tag\">分离焦虑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Am I Messing Up My Kid? with Jenny Slate Purple Noise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-goodinside-她说表演失误从不往心里去-当妈妈却做什么都往心里去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">48:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>她说表演失误从不往心里去，当妈妈却做什么都往心里去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jenny Slate发现，表演时犯错她能立刻翻篇、毫不内耗，但当妈妈时，哪怕做得很好，她也会把每一刻都当成对自己的审判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">自我接纳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Don’t send the police, send Freedom House swoop and scoop Freedom House Ambulance Service\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-throughline-美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1935x1935+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Fe3%2Fe5%2Fc0af44ec41dea4b145842458034d%2F35d18c21-c972-4491-bcf5-84652a92c86c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全美第一批真正受过训练的急救医护人员，不是来自医院，而是匹兹堡希尔区一个黑人社区组织，用退役警车改装救护车，靠自己的社区信任撑起了全国 EMS 体系的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国黑人历史</span><span class=\"tag\">急救医疗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Introducing… Are we Doomed? Just a Minor Sun Explosion coronal mass ejection (CME) geomagnetic storm black swan event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-cautionary-1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网-而我们比当时更脆弱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46364baa48914de6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网，而我们比当时更脆弱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太阳级大型磁暴每150到200年就会发生一次，我们现在欠了一次账；但对付它的办法出奇地简单——提前几小时把设备关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太阳磁暴</span><span class=\"tag\">电网安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"纪录片导演陈晓卿×罗永浩！他一直被命运推着，却走出了自己的路 年鉴学派 Direct Cinema\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-cn2d7912-陈晓卿-北方菜总被吐槽难吃-根源是权力结构不是物产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/24b8dd80f1acd840-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>陈晓卿：北方菜总被吐槽难吃，根源是权力结构不是物产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陈晓卿说，中国历史上文化积累随战乱不断南迁，北方留下的是权力与仪式性的饮食传统，南方留下的是商业化、精致化的味觉体系，这是今天南北美食口碑差距的根源，而不是简单的物产贫富。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">纪录片</span><span class=\"tag\">美食文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"8,000+ NVIDIA Employees Want Jensen Back, FAA Meltdown, Starship CAUGHT! | E2364 Dream Weaver minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-twist-餐厅没有护城河-留住客人靠的不是菜-是被记住的那个瞬间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3fb05349600f03e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>餐厅没有护城河：留住客人靠的不是菜，是被记住的那个瞬间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">11 Madison Park 前老板说，产品和品牌迟早会被超越，唯一长期不可复制的竞争优势是持续、慷慨地投入关系——也就是「不合理的待客之道」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">客户体验</span><span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Visual Intelligence — Andreas Blattmann &amp; Dustin Podell, Black Forest Labs flow matching / rectified flow diffusion transformer (DiT) world action model in-context learning (for robotics) refiner (SDXL)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-latentspace-flux-context-诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6784492d9a9b6c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>Flux Context 诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这款被视为下一代图像编辑引擎的模型，最初只是一人用一个小数据集、几小时训练做出的侧项目，却意外跑出了通用的空间关系理解能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">扩散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">图像生成</span>\n</div></div></a>"]